<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK 1-WEEK REV REPO AVE YIELD 15.98 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK 1-WEEK REV REPO AVE YIELD 15.98 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at the Czech central bank's (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity on Wednesday was unchanged at 15.98 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It added that 93 percent of bids at that rate were satisfied.</p>
<p>The CNB does not reveal the amount of funds it drains in its open market operations.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
